  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mama Cash 2022-2024 (2026) - Mama Cash 2022-2024 (2026) - ISK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mama Cash 2022-2024 (2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det som &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r implementering av Mama Cash:s strategisk plan 2015-2019. Planen omfattar f&#xf6;ljande komponenter:      1)st&#xf6;d till mindre och medelstor kvinnor&#xe4;ttsorganisationer; 2)        kvinnor&#xe4;ttsfonder; samt 3) kommunikation och resursmobilisering. I    f&#xf6;rslaget ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven att st&#xe4;rka Mama Cash som organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support is for implementation of MamaCash&apos;s strategic plan   2015-2019. The plan covers the following components: 1) Fund and      support women&apos;s &amp; girls&apos; human rights organisations; 2) Build a       strong global architecture of women&apos;s funds; and 3) Communicate their core message, and promote women&apos;s and girls&apos; rights, learning, and    community-building. Organisational dev is also part of the plan.</narrative>
  </description>
